{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NAM","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"那鴻書","commonName":"那鴻書","title":"那鴻書","order":34,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"6864a0b55315302c1d2f10b5b4421eee104e8e7528ba32c5bd70e07385cb10b5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NAM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NAM/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":47},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["尼尼微的災禍"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"充滿血腥的尼尼微有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城中充滿詭詐和掠奪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"害人的事從未止息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鞭聲啪啪，車輪隆隆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"戰馬奔騰，戰車疾馳，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"騎士衝鋒，刀光閃閃，矛槍生輝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被殺者眾多，屍骨成堆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人們被遍地的屍體絆倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這全是因為尼尼微像妖媚的妓女大肆淫亂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"慣行邪術，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以淫行誘惑列國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"靠邪術欺騙各族。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"萬軍之耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我與你為敵。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把你的衣裙掀到你臉上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使列國看見你的裸體，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使列邦看見你的羞恥。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把可憎之物拋在你身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羞辱你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓眾人觀看。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡看見你的都要逃避，說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『尼尼微毀滅了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰會為她悲傷呢？』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我到哪裡去尋找安慰你的人呢？」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"你能強過底比斯","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"底比斯位於尼羅河上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"四面環水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水是她的屏障，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又是她的城牆。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古實和埃及是她無窮的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"弗人和利比亞人是她的幫手。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是，她卻被擄去，流落他鄉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的嬰孩被摔死在各個街頭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的官長被抽籤瓜分，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她所有的首領都被鎖鏈鎖著。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尼尼微啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你也必像醉漢一樣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必尋找藏身之處躲避敵人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你所有的堡壘都像無花果樹上的初熟果子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一搖樹，果子就掉進吃者口中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的軍隊就像柔弱的女人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你境內的關口向敵人敞開，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的門閂被火燒毀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"你要蓄水以防圍困，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要加強防禦！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要走進土坑踩泥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿起磚模造磚！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但在那裡，火要吞噬你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刀劍要殺戮你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要像蝗蟲吞沒你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你只管像蝗蟲一樣繁殖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如蚱蜢一般增多吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的商賈多過天上的繁星，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他們像吃光田地後飛去的蝗蟲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的臣僕像蝗蟲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的將領像成群的蚱蜢。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠們寒日聚集在牆上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"太陽一出來就飛走了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人知道牠們的行蹤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞述王啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的牧人沉睡，貴族酣眠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的百姓分散在群山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人招聚他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的創傷無法救治，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的傷勢極其嚴重。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽見這消息的人必鼓掌歡呼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為誰沒受過你無休止的暴虐呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"「底比斯」希伯來文是「挪亞們」。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NAM/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NAM/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}